== 3. Governance-gate trigger fact (affects the merge procedure) ==
.github/workflows governance gate: on: pull_request: branches:[main] with default activity types (opened, synchronize, reopened).
Editing a PR title/body ("edited") does NOT re-trigger it. After the owner removes the marker the failed run must be re-run
(Re-run jobs) or a new commit pushed; otherwise the red check stays.
Marker regexes (scripts/check_do_not_merge.py) scan the WHOLE title+body, including historical annexes:
  do[\s-]*not[\s-]*merge | hold[\s-]*merge | لا\s*يُ?دُ?مُ?ج | لا\s*يَدْمُ?ج | لا\s*يدمج
  ("ممنوع الدمج" is not matched.)

